  "details": "Recent generations of my avi impostor have the head offset to one side that did not previously happen. \n\nThis model has a gimmick where it can remove its head by constraining the bone to the left hand, and it _looks_ like the impostor is being generated with that constraint at half weight even though it's _never_ set to half weight in unity.\n\n(the floating discs are a different unrelated older issue)\n\nImages in order\n\nBroken impostor\n\nModel the broken impostor is generating from\n\nOlder functional impostor on a similar model\n\nModel that older impostor was generated from",
